{
  "status": "complete",
  "jobs": [
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00000",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "特朗普与经济"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00001",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "纽约——金融市场终于意识到唐纳德·特朗普是美国总统。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00002",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "鉴于世界已经经历了两年来世界上最强大的人随意发布的推文和公开言论，显而易见的问题是，为什么这么久才发生这种情况？"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00003",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "一方面，到目前为止，投资者曾相信特朗普只是气势汹汹而没有实际行动。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00004",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "他们愿意给他以信任，只要他继续推行减税、放松管制和其他有利于企业界和股东的政策。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00005",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "许多人相信，最终，“房间里的成年人”会约束特朗普，确保政府的政策不会突破正统性的界限。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00006",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这些假设在特朗普就职第一年基本上得到了验证，当时经济增长和企业利润的预期增长——由于即将出台的减税和放松管制政策——导致股市表现强劲。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00007",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "2017年，美国股市指数上涨超过20%。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00008",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "但2018年情况发生了根本性的变化，尤其是在最近几个月。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00009",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "尽管企业利润增长超过20%（得益于减税），但美国股市在大部分时间里横盘震荡，如今却大幅下跌。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00010",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "在此时，广泛指数已进入修正区域（指从最近高点下跌10%），而科技股指数，如纳斯达克指数，已进入熊市区域（下跌20%或更多）。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00011",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "尽管金融市场的高波动性反映了对中国、意大利和其他欧元区经济体以及主要新兴经济体的担忧，但大部分近期的动荡归因于特朗普。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00012",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这一年开始时，一项鲁莽的减税政策出台，结果推高了长期利率，让已经接近充分就业的经济达到高潮。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00013",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "早在二月，人们对通货膨胀率超过美国联邦储备委员会2%目标的担忧加剧，导致了今年首次的风险规避。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00014",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "随后是特朗普与中国及其他关键美国贸易伙伴之间的贸易战。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00015",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "市场对政府保护主义政策的担忧在整个年度中时高时低，但现在正达到一个新的高点。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00016",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "最新的美国对华行动似乎预示着一场更广泛的贸易、经济和地缘政治冷战。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00017",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "另一个担忧是特朗普的其他政策可能会产生滞胀效应（经济增长放缓同时通货膨胀率上升）。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00018",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "毕竟，特朗普计划限制外资流入，他已经实施了广泛的移民限制措施，这将在劳动力老龄化和技能错配问题日益严重的时期，减少劳动力供给的增长。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00019",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "此外，特朗普政府尚未提出刺激私人部门生产率，以加快向绿色经济的转型的基础设施计划。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00020",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "并且在推特和其他地方，特朗普继续批评企业，针对它们的雇用、生产、投资和定价行为，尤其是在科技公司正面临更广泛 backlash 和来自其中国同行日益增加的竞争之时，他特别针对这些公司。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00021",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "新兴市场也受到了美国政策的冲击。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00022",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "财政刺激和货币政策收紧推高了短期和长期利率，加强了美元。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00023",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "因此，新兴经济体经历了资本外流和美元计价债务的增加。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00024",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "那些严重依赖出口的国家已经感受到了商品价格下跌的影响，而所有与中国间接进行贸易的国家都感受到了贸易战的影响。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00025",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "即使特朗普的石油政策也造成了高波动性。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00026",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国对伊朗重新实施制裁推高了油价后，政府努力争取豁免权并迫使沙特阿拉伯增加自身的产量，导致油价大幅下跌。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00027",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "尽管美国消费者受益于油价下跌，但美国能源公司的股价却没有上涨。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00028",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "此外，油价的高波动性对生产者和消费者都是不利的，因为它阻碍了合理的投资和消费决策。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00029",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "使情况更加恶化的是，现在很明显，去年减税带来的好处几乎全部流向了企业界，而不是以实际（通货膨胀调整后）工资的形式惠及家庭。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00030",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这意味着家庭消费可能会很快放缓，进一步拖累经济。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00031",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "尽管企业盈利增长超过20%（得益于减税），但美国股市在大部分时间里走势平平，现在却出现了急剧下跌。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00032",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "甚至比与中国的全面贸易战风险加剧（尽管最近与习近平主席达成了“停火”协议）更糟糕的是，特朗普自2018年春季以来就公开攻击美联储，当时美国经济以超过4%的速度增长。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00033",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "鉴于此前的这些攻击，当美联储正确决定加息的同时，还表明2019年加息步伐将更为渐进时，市场本月感到恐慌。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00034",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "最有可能的是，美联储相对鹰派的立场是对特朗普对其威胁的反应。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00035",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "面对敌对的总统推文，美联储主席杰罗姆·鲍威尔需要表明央行仍保持政治独立性。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00036",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "但随后特朗普做出决定，关闭联邦政府的大部分部门，以抗议国会拒绝为其毫无用处的墨西哥边境墙提供资金。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00037",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这使市场陷入近似恐慌，政府停摆不久后，又传出特朗普想要解雇鲍威尔的消息——这一举动可能使市场回调演变为崩盘。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00038",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "圣诞节假期前夕，美国财政部长史蒂文·穆努钦被迫发表公开声明以安抚市场。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00039",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "他宣布特朗普最终并没有打算解雇鲍威尔，同时表示美国银行的财务状况稳健，实际上凸显了他们是否真的如此稳健这一问题。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00040",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "最近政府内部的一些变动，不一定影响经济政策制定，也正在动摇市场。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00041",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "白宫幕僚长约翰·凯利和国防部长詹姆斯·马蒂斯即将离任，这将使房间中失去所有成年人。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00042",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "仍将继续迎合特朗普每一个意愿的经济民族主义者和外交政策鹰派集团。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00043",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "目前来看，对华的全面地缘政治冲突的可能性无法排除。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00044",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "新的冷战将实际上导致去全球化，扰乱各个领域的供应链，尤其是在科技领域，最近的中兴和华为案例都是明证。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00045",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "与此同时，特朗普似乎一心要削弱欧洲联盟和北约的凝聚力，而此时欧洲在经济和政治上都处于脆弱状态。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00046",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "并且特别检察官罗伯特·穆勒对特朗普2016年竞选活动与俄罗斯之间联系的调查，如同达摩克利斯之剑一样悬在他的总统任期之上。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00047",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "特朗普现在是金融市场的“奇爱博士”。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00048",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "就像斯坦利·库布里克（Stanley Kubrick）经典电影中的偏执狂暴君一样，他正在玩火，试图造成相互保证的经济毁灭。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_3:en:00049",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "现在，市场看到了危险，金融危机和全球衰退的风险已经逐渐上升。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00000",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国对华技术的战争"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00001",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "发自纽约——过去一代，也许是更长一段时间内，美国最糟糕的外交政策决定是2003年它以消除所谓大规模杀伤性武器为名发动的“选择性战争”，而这些武器实际上并不存在。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00002",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "理解那个灾难性决定背后的荒谬逻辑，如今比以往任何时候都更加相关，因为这种逻辑正被用来为当今同样 misguided 的美国政策进行辩护。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00003",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "入侵伊拉克的决定遵循了时任美国副总统理查德·切尼的非逻辑思维，他宣称，即使生化武器落入恐怖分子手中的风险微乎其微——比如说，只有1%——我们也应该像该情景一定会发生一样采取行动。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00004",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这种推理方式往往会导致错误的决策。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00005",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "然而，美国及其某些盟国现在正利用切尼主义来攻击中国科技。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00006",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国政府认为，由于我们无法确定中国的科技是安全的，所以我们应该按照将其定义为必定有害的理解去应对并予以封杀。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00007",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "正确的决策应将概率估计应用于替代行动。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00008",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "一代之前，美国政策制定者本应不仅考虑生化武器落入恐怖分子手中的（所谓）1%风险，还应考虑基于错误前提的战争有99%的风险。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00009",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "仅关注1%的风险，切尼（以及许多人）转移了公众对伊拉克战争缺乏正当性以及该战争可能严重破坏中东和全球政治的更大可能性的注意力。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00010",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "切尼主义的问题不仅仅在于它规定采取基于小风险的行动，而没有考虑潜在的极高成本。政治家们容易为了其他目的煽动人们的恐惧。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00011",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这正是美国领导人再次所做的：通过夸大微小的风险，制造对中国科技公司的恐慌。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00012",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "最相关的一个案例（但并非唯一的一个）是美国政府对无线宽带公司华为的攻击。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00013",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国正在关闭其市场，针对该公司并努力在全球范围内关闭其业务。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00014",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "正如伊拉克的情况一样，美国可能会无端地制造一场地缘政治灾难。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00015",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "我一直在关注华为在技术进步方面的工作，以及其在发展中国家的发展，因为我相信5G和其他数字技术能够为消除贫困和其他可持续发展目标带来巨大的推动作用。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00016",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "我同样与其他电信公司有过互动，并鼓励行业采取更多行动以实现可持续发展目标。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00017",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "当我为一份关于该主题的华为报告撰写了一篇简短的前言（未获得报酬）时，遭到了中国的反对者批评，我向行业和政府的高级官员请求提供华为从事不当活动的证据。我反复听到的是，华为的行为与其他值得信赖的行业领袖并无不同。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00018",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国政府认为，华为的5G设备可能破坏全球安全。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00019",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "华为的软件或硬件中存在一个“后门”，美国官员声称，这可能使中国政府能够在全球范围内进行监视。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00020",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "他们指出中国的法律要求中国企业为国家安全目的配合政府工作。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00021",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "但现在事实就是这些。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00022",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "华为的5G设备成本低且质量高，目前领先于许多竞争对手，并已开始部署。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00023",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "其高性能源于多年来在研究与开发、规模经济以及中国数字市场中的学习效应方面的大量投入。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00024",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "鉴于该技术对它们的可持续发展具有重要意义，世界各地的低收入经济体如果拒绝早日推出5G就显然将是不明智的。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00025",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "然而，尽管没有提供后门的证据，美国却告诉世界不要远离华为。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00026",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国的主张是普适性的。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00027",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "正如一位美国联邦通信委员会成员所言：“拥有5G技术的国家将掌握创新并为世界其他国家设定标准，而目前不太可能成为美国的国家。”"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00028",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "其他国家，尤其是英国，未在华为的硬件和软件中发现后门。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00029",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "即使后来发现了后门，也几乎肯定可以在那时将其关闭。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00030",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "德国围绕华为的争论持续升级，美国政府威胁要限制情报合作，除非当局排除华为的5G技术。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00031",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "也许是迫于美国的压力，德国情报首脑最近做出了一项相当于切尼主义的声明：“基础设施不是一个可以完全不被信任的团体适合涉足的领域。”"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00032",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "他没有提供任何具体的罪行的证据。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00033",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "相比之下，德国总理安格拉·默克尔则在幕后努力进行抗争以对华为开放市场。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00034",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "颇具讽刺意味的是，尽管可以预见，美国的抱怨在一定程度上反映了美国自身在国内和国外的监控活动。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00035",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "中国的设备可能会使美国政府的秘密监视变得更加困难。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00036",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "但任何政府的无根据监视都应终止。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00037",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "独立的联合国监测应成为全球电信系统的一部分，以遏制此类活动。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00038",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "简而言之，我们应该选择外交和制度保障，而不是技术战争。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00039",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国要求封锁华为的威胁不仅仅关乎5G网络的早期部署，对基于规则的贸易体系的风险也是深远的。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00040",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "现在美国已不再是世界上无可争议的技术领导者，美国总统唐纳德·特朗普及其顾问们并不希望按照基于规则的体系进行竞争。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00041",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "他们的目标是遏制中国的技术崛起。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00042",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "他们同时试图通过破坏其争端解决机制来中立世界贸易组织，显示出对全球规则同样的蔑视。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00043",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "如果特朗普政府“成功”地将世界划分为不同的技术阵营，未来冲突的风险将会倍增。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00044",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "美国在第二次世界大战后倡导开放贸易，不仅是为了提高全球效率和扩大美国技术的市场，也是为了逆转1930年代国际贸易的崩溃。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00045",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这一崩溃部分源于美国在1930年通过的《斯穆特-霍利法案》所实施的保护主义关税，该法案加剧了大萧条，进而促成了希特勒的崛起，最终导致了第二次世界大战的爆发。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00046",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "与其他领域一样，在国际事务中煽动恐惧并依据恐惧行事，而不是依据证据行事，是一条走向毁灭的道路。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00047",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "让我们坚持理性、证据和规则作为最安全的行动方式。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00048",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "让我们创建独立的监督机构，以遏制任何国家利用全球网络对他国进行监视或网络战争的威胁。"
      },
      "selector_status": "dpo",
      "revised_hypothesis": false
    },
    {
      "source_id": "news_commentary_v18.1:nc_6:en:00049",
      "phase": "target",
      "status": "complete",
      "eval_reply": {
        "text": "这样，世界就可以赶紧利用突破性的数字技术为全球福祉服务。"
      },
      "selector_status": null,
      "revised_hypothesis": true
    }
  ]
}
